[h1]Food Drying Extended[/h1]

[b]Build 42.21 · Singleplayer & Multiplayer[/b]

Adds more food to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747396551]Food Drying [B42][/url] by Corvus, using its own trays, skewers and drying rack.

[h2]More food in Food Drying's recipes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Vegetables: Brussels sprouts, cucumber, pumpkin, sweet potato, turnip, zucchini, cabbage, sugar beet, garlic, green onions.
[*]Fruit: watermelon slices, rose hips. Jalapeño and habanero peppers in the oven and on a skewer.
[*]Wild plants: dandelions, ginger root, grape leaves, violets, thistles, nettles, lemongrass, ginseng.
[*]They go into Food Drying's own tray, skewer and drying rack recipes (no extra menu entry). One fresh item gives one dried item with the same nutrition, and it keeps for months.
[/list]

[h2]New recipes[/h2]
[table]
[tr][th]Recipe[/th][th]Ingredients[/th][th]Result[/th][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Prepare a Tray of Homemade Crisps[/b][/td][td]Baking tray, knife, salt, 1 to 8 potatoes, sweet potatoes, sugar beets, zucchini or kale (mixed)[/td][td]Tray to bake 40 min[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Prepare a Tray of Crisps with Oil[/b][/td][td]Same, plus 8 uses of oil[/td][td]Tray to bake 40 min; each portion gets +70 kcal, +8 g of fat and makes you happier[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Put Homemade Crisps in a Paper Bag[/b][/td][td]1 portion of homemade crisps, 1 empty paper bag[/td][td]Bag of crisps: fresh twice as long (30 days), bag given back once eaten[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Prepare a Tray of Fruit Leather[/b][/td][td]Baking tray, fork or spoon, 4 fruits or berries (mixed)[/td][td]Tray to bake 2 h[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Prepare a Tray of Insects to Roast[/b][/td][td]Baking tray, 1 to 20 crickets, grasshoppers, sawfly larvae or caterpillars[/td][td]Tray to roast 30 min[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Empty the Baking Tray[/b][/td][td]A tray of this mod, after the oven[/td][td]1 portion of crisps per vegetable (14 days), 4 rolls of fruit leather (average nutrition, months), or roasted insects (6 months); raw food back if not baked[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Salt Seafood[/b][/td][td]Shrimp, squid, crayfish or oysters, 5 uses of salt[/td][td]Salted seafood, then dried on the drying rack like salted fish (months)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Dry Wild Plants[/b][/td][td]On the herb drying rack: 1 to 20 wild plants[/td][td]Dried wild plants after 1 day (ginger, lemongrass and ginseng still make tea)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Grind into Seasoning[/b][/td][td]Mortar and pestle, 4 dried basil, chives, cilantro, oregano, parsley, rosemary, sage or thyme[/td][td]1 jar of the matching seasoning[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Requires Food Drying. Load this mod after Food Drying (and after its VFE patch if you use it).
[*]The drying rack recipes file of Food Drying is replaced by an updated copy (based on Food Drying 1.11) that adds the new food.
[*]Languages: English, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Turkish.
[/list]

